   "all_day": false,
   "venue": "",
   "address": "",
   "url": "https://www.phillydsa.org/events",
   "description": "<h5><strong>More Info and RSVP:</strong></h5>\n    <p><a href=\"https://actionnetwork.org/events/the-dispossessed-book-club-session-5\">https://actionnetwork.org/events/the-dispossessed-book-club-session-5</a></p>\n    \n    <h5><strong>Description:</strong></h5>\n    <p>Join Philly DSA for an exploration of the anarchist philosophy through the Science Fiction Novel <em>The Dispossessed </em>By Ursula K. Le Guin. Join to discuss, understand, and critique anarchist philosophy by examining an imagined example of what such a society could look like through virtual discussion.</p><p>This is a <strong>theory light</strong><strong><em> </em></strong><strong>reading group</strong>, anarchist theory will be examined as optional supplements, but any reading beyond the novel will be done together during the session.</p><p>This session will cover Chapters 7-8.</p><div><br></div>",
